 font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">7</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">일 전까지</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; ※ 첨부 파일 참조</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">7.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">훈련 입소시유의사항</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;가</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">훈련복장 규정 준수</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">예비군복</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">전투화</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">군용혁띠</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">고무줄 필히 착용</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">)</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;나</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">개인증명 신분증 반드시 휴대</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">학생증</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">주민등록증</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">운전면허증</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">여권</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">)</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">8.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">참고사항</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">교통비는 훈련 종료시 군부대에서 지급</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">.</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">훈련 참석 후 교육필증이 필요한 학생은 예비군연대에서 출력 가능</span><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">공결계 서류</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">)</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; 다</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">기타 문의사항은 예비군연대</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">디지털관&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">122</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">호</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">방문 또는 전화</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">☎</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">478-7158)</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">바람</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">2019. 4.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">금오공과대학교직장예비군연대장</span></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
